    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip. i checked the soil and it definitely feels pretty soggy, even though i haven't watered it in like a week. i'm worried i might have actually killed it if the roots are rotting. is there anything else i should look for to tell if it's just a temporary thing or if something way worse is happening under the surface?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
